                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "The outer branches reach the middle branch's height at the break points:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2-(-2)&=4\\\\2+2&=4\\end{align*}$$\n\nDraw $y=2-x$ for $x<-2$, the horizontal segment $y=4$ for $-2\\le x\\le2$, and $y=x+2$ for $x>2$. Label each branch with its equation. The middle branch includes $(-2,4)$ and $(2,4)$, so the complete graph is connected at both joins.",
